    <section>
      <h2>Projects</h2>

      <div class="project-entry">
        <div class="entry-header">
          <span class="project-name"
            >MySkin.Today — AI Multi-modal Smart Skin Analysis SaaS</span
          >
          <span class="project-role">Product Designer & AI Full-Stack Lead</span
          >
        </div>
        <div class="project-meta">
          <a href="https://myskin.today" target="_blank">myskin.today</a> ·
          <a href="https://github.com/Wilboerht" target="_blank">GitHub</a> · Dec
          2025 - Present
        </div>
        <p class="project-abstract">
          An AI multi-modal skin analysis SaaS empowering the skincare industry
          (ToB), compatible with Direct-to-Consumer (DTC) mode. Utilizing "Photo
          + Questionnaire + Environmental Data" 3D input to generate
          clinical-grade 8-dimension skin scores and zonal diagnosis. Designed a
          Guest (1/week) → Member (Unlock Report) → VIP (AR Heatmap/5 daily)
          growth funnel and a commercial closed-loop based on browser
          fingerprinting.
        </p>
        <ul class="project-points">
          <li>
            <strong>Multi-Model AI Orchestration:</strong> Architected a 5-provider
            AI gateway (OpenAI/Anthropic/Gemini/Qwen/DeepSeek) supporting multi-key
            rotation, auto-fallback chains, and CMS hot-switching. Implemented a mixed
            pipeline: "Adaptive Resizing (1024px) → Vision Analysis → Questionnaire
            Fusion"; designed an AI request queue for concurrency control (Vision
            3/Chat 10) and queue feedback.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Edge Computing & High-Perf Frontend:</strong> Integrated MediaPipe
            Face Mesh (WASM) for client-side 468-point feature extraction, enabling
            zero-GPU-cost VIP exclusive Real-time AR Heatmaps (~900 triangle mesh
            reconstruction + HSL interpolation). Encapsulated <code
              >useAsyncAnalysis</code
            >
            two-phase state machine with exponential backoff retry.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Full-Stack Architecture & Security:</strong> Designed 15+ model
            schema using Prisma 7 + PostgreSQL (Supabase). Built a triple-layer defense:
            JWT Auth + LRU In-memory Rate Limiting (Brute-force 5/15min, API 100/min)
            + FingerprintJS Anti-scraping (IP/Cookie/Device cross-matching with confidence
            scoring).
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Scientific Skincare Algorithm:</strong> Led the R&D of the Dermatologist
            Grade Algorithm (~1000 lines) in collaboration with a skincare consultant
            team, fusing skin type, BioFactors, and real-time environmental factors
            to generate 3-tier regimens × 4 scenarios; outputting a 28-day Skin Cycling
            calendar (Retinol → Acid → Repair → Barrier).
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Product Knowledge Graph Engine:</strong> Built an ingredient-efficacy
            matching engine that dynamically maps AI diagnostic results to Daily/Advanced/Ultimate
            product combinations, dynamically adjusting recommendation ranking based
            on environmental factors (e.g., UV weighted sunscreen).
          </li>
        </ul>
        <div class="tech-tags">
