            and floating cards, and a 6-step Q&A interaction experience.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Product Design:</strong> Led the product planning of the AI Skincare
            Advisor, completed competitive analysis (Aesop, Le Labo) and PRD writing,
            designing the complete user journey of "Q&A Interaction → Skin Analysis
            → Skincare Advice → Product Recommendation".
          </li>
        </ul>
